<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thus we are being transformed</l><l>Metabolic’lly to have His life-shape</l><l>By His life-pow’r with His life-essence,</l><l>Transfigured by renewing our mind.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
